Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.06,0:00:04.65,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)\pos(960,780)}July 12th (Monday) 5:05 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Yoshikage, my darling\Nboy, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've looked all over and\Ncan't find you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have been forced to change\Nyour face and name and go into hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart aches for you, my poor son.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.66,0:00:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure they pay dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to look further into\Nthe recent missing person cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That includes runaways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, didn't Kira go into hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.76,0:00:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think he'd risk capture\Nby continuing his murdering spree?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.62,0:00:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't be able to brush\Naside his murderous impulses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just how serial killers work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.06,0:00:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He will kill again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if just waiting for something\Nto happen is the best way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all this time we still haven't\Nfound a single clue leading us to Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.46,0:00:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's been bothering me a lot, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:00:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you guys remember what\NJotaro said, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.58,0:01:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as he finds something,\Nwe spring to action.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.22,0:01:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to him, we should go back\Nto being ordinary students until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.80,0:01:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather hunt down that bastard Kira\Nthan go back to hitting the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.70,0:01:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We almost got him before, so I\Nbet the next time we see him,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll be a one-two knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.91,0:01:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and since I'm repairing the fire damage,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.70,0:01:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to have some\Nrenovations done, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.78,0:01:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That little punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's snapping pictures of\Npeople in search of my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, would you mind giving me an estimate?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.48,0:01:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro and his insufferable stand-user\Nposse think they're so smart!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.02,0:01:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll annihilate these parasites!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.50,0:01:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the best way to do that is\Nby creating new stand-users!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.07,0:01:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.34,0:01:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.34,0:01:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Altered appearance or not, the bond\Nof a father and son can't be broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could never mistake my son for another!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.20,0:01:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found you at last, Yoshikage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.54,0:02:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.18,0:02:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find out who you\Nreally are, imposter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.86,0:02:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.76,0:02:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that brat uncovers my son's secret,\Nthe stand users will sniff him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.58,0:02:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.72,0:02:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to put an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.62,0:02:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll protect Yoshikage with\Nevery fiber of my being.
