Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.75,0:03:55.33,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(141,887)\fs60}Episode 31: {\fs80} July 15th (Thursday) Part 1
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.04,0:04:01.97,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1000)\pos(960,780)}July 15th (Thursday) 8:02 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.98,0:04:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stayed up way too late. I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.94,0:04:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that sucks for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.42,0:04:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look like a rock, so I'm\Nfeeling as fit as a fiddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.40,0:04:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out, Josuke! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some random binoculars!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody must have left them behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.60,0:04:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it doesn't take much to pique\Nyour interest, does it, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't pick them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.66,0:04:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.57,0:04:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.84,0:04:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can assure you I am not gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.28,0:04:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Josuke and Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.90,0:04:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.24,0:04:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't scare us like that, Mikitaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.22,0:04:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.13,0:04:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart isn't built\Nfor that kind of shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're being too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't a compliment, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.28,0:04:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's high time for you to come\Nclean about something, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alien Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.71,0:04:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not actually from\Nouter space, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.94,0:04:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a run-of-the-mill\Nstand-user who believes he's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an alien for some reason spell\Nthe beans all this lion ain't cool
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.24,0:04:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.34,0:05:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no beans and I\Nreally am an alien There
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.60,0:05:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you go talking like a\Nfreaking weirdo again,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so here's a question for you Why were you\Nlying out here as a pair of binoculars?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a little weird. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted the two of you to see something\Nhence my waiting here in the open
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.84,0:05:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.55,0:05:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a transmission tower, to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.66,0:05:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, you don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.56,0:05:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh, calling it that might be a bit of a\Nstretch, without any of its power lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.94,0:05:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more of a relic of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When redevelopment took over here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,most of the excess power lines were\Ntaken down and moved underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you want us to see that old thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.48,0:05:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're using to\Ncommunicate with life on other planets?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.72,0:05:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless I'm mistaken, there's smoke wafting\Nup from around the center of the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.26,0:05:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, how weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please use me to take a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.14,0:05:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.10,0:06:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a kettle! Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.56,0:06:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.00,0:06:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That tower is like 20 meters in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.34,0:06:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, but aim me about\Nfive meters higher. Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.32,0:06:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't see that every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop hogging the alien, I wanna see!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.16,0:06:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, it's a dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.44,0:06:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a guy sitting up\Nthere cooking some grub!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that tower might be\Nhis home, and he looks comfy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he's probably spent\Nhis entire life up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.66,0:06:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can fish from the river and\Nhe's got cucumbers growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.02,0:06:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice, that's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.78,0:06:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like this guy is living in one\Nof those fancy self-sufficient homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.40,0:06:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This world has no shortages\Nof curious individuals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:06:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see that? This guy has to be a new\NStand user. He just flew right through.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.20,0:07:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the air like it was nothing yeah i know\Nbut what's a stand user doing living
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on a transmission tower if we want to\Nfind out the answer to that i believe
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll need to take a closer look what do
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.46,0:07:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, they've\Narrived at last. I wonder
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what i did to finally catch their curious\Neyes come on over it's been quite a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.64,0:07:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while since i've indulged in a little chit\Nchat check it out looks like that tower
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.66,0:07:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dude might have noticed that we noticed\Nhim you want to get closer oh yeah but
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have to play it safe we still don't I\Ndon't know if that user is on our side,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or if he's angling to take us out.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.48,0:07:50.40,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,380)\pos(960,780)}July 15th (Thursday) 8:05 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.24,0:07:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there something I can do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.38,0:08:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to be rude, but I'm kinda in...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.08,0:08:06.75,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,422)\pos(960,780)}July 15th (Thursday) 8:11 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.34,0:08:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing looks a lot bigger\Nonce you get up close to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.90,0:08:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you fellas know what's good for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll stop right there\Nand won't get any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you two hear what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.62,0:08:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.53,0:08:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just answered the call\Nof nature, and trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.76,0:08:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you don't want to be\Nthere to get the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.82,0:08:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really not following.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.22,0:08:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say I didn't warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.26,0:08:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I needed to fertilize the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.72,0:08:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impolite!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.74,0:08:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I designed this nifty\Ncontraption so it would
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.34,0:08:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,distribute the fertilizer\Nto all the plants below.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.34,0:08:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all about that zero-waste\Nlifestyle, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the right are Asiatic dayflowers,\Nmountain asparagus, and watercress.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.94,0:08:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all completely edible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.02,0:08:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with all of these plants around,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.14,0:09:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,catching nibbling rabbits is a cinch, so\NI've got the best of both worlds, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.10,0:09:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, so you're really\Nliving up there all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't this tower belong\Nto some electric company?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.84,0:09:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.44,0:09:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I paid for this house with my own money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bought this abandoned\Ntower for 100,000 yen and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.66,0:09:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,transformed it into my\Nself-sufficient dream house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.20,0:09:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bought it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.36,0:09:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For 100,000 yen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.52,0:09:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.66,0:09:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a steal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I support myself, I'm not\Nstuck working for some lame company.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.24,0:09:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pretty sweet life\Nif you think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.28,0:09:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have to leave the house, and I\Nget all the exercise I could ever need.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.36,0:09:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, do you see this view?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.24,0:09:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's spectacular.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.54,0:09:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, run that by me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.66,0:09:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't even have to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.28,0:09:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how long have you been\Nliving up there anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.64,0:09:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I've been here\Nfor about three years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.51,0:09:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three years?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.48,0:09:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I probably haven't touched\Nterra firma in nearly a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.88,0:09:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do, Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.70,0:09:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea such an idiot was living\Nright under our noses in Morioh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, he's a pure great nutcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.62,0:10:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just living out a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.20,0:10:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no way he'd be\Ndumb enough to attack us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, at least, our best option is\Nheading back and reporting to Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again, something just\Ndoesn't feel right about this.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.51,0:10:22.51,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,725)\pos(960,780)}July 15th (Thursday) 10:15 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.58,0:10:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose children like to\Ntake videos like anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.86,0:10:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why is he hiding behind that pillar?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.38,0:10:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost as if he's up\Nto the same thing I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.26,0:10:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's following someone and\Ncapturing their every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.12,0:10:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could his target be\Nsomeone in this picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.76,0:10:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato Kawajiri, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.62,0:10:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something very\Nunusual about this kid.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.93,0:11:06.93,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)\pos(960,780)}July 15th (Thursday) 7:33 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.42,0:11:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm home! Huh?
