Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.82,0:11:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.44,0:11:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could go for some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.84,0:11:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.62,0:11:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That little shit only\Nthinks about himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.84,0:11:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He takes a giant bite out\Nof my favorite Comic-Core
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.64,0:11:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,custer and pops it back in the\Nfridge like it never happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.38,0:11:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there were two in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.94,0:11:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the other one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.38,0:11:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that kid pisses me off sometimes.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.06,0:11:50.43,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,550)\pos(960,780)}July 15th (Thursday) 8:14 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.54,0:11:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look sharp!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.04,0:11:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something fell out of your pocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:12:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that a photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you two mind skedaddling and -\NDon't worry about picking that picture up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.56,0:12:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like an ordinary Polaroid to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.92,0:12:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he so freaked out?\NIt's fine! Just leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.22,0:12:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.34,0:12:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on, Josuke? That blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Kira's old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.28,0:12:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should've known your crusty\Nass was behind all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.84,0:12:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've stepped into my abode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.42,0:12:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you tell someone to come in,\Nthey chicken out and refuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if you tell them the opposite,\Nthey get pissed and enter!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.08,0:12:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've at long last entered into\NSuperfly, Higashikata Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I've what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.52,0:12:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done, Toyohiro Kanedaichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.14,0:12:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lured him in, hook, line, and sinker!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.34,0:12:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now our friend Josuke has a new home!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.84,0:12:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gudos, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds bad, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.26,0:12:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.38,0:12:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get moving, Josuke! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.32,0:12:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We finally found Kira's dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.16,0:12:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's got the arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.46,0:13:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.44,0:13:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.32,0:13:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're confused,\Nso let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once someone steps into the tower's realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.12,0:13:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it won't spit them out until\Nits next victim steps in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.22,0:13:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, if they try to force their way\Nout, they simply become part of the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.48,0:13:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the secret ability of my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.94,0:13:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Superfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.26,0:13:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got you now, Josuke Higashikata!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.26,0:13:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure he stays nice and\Ncomfy now, Toyohiro! Ahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.54,0:13:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyousuke!
