Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.30,0:13:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyousuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.40,0:13:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.02,0:13:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a bit of a confession to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.36,0:13:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Superfly is indeed my stand, but\Nit isn't exactly under my control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.08,0:14:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It pretty much does whatever it wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that you're here, I can take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.38,0:14:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been trapped by Superfly\Nfor the entirety of my stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.02,0:14:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, take care of her for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.12,0:14:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a life to enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.63,0:14:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sly son of a bitch is in cahoots with\Nthat grandpa ghost dude from the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.43,0:14:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu, is there any way I could\Npossibly be of assistance to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.16,0:14:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll just get hurt, so stay out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your assistance is no longer needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.00,0:14:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.91,0:14:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you could change your\Nbody into some sticks
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.14,0:14:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dynamite instead of dice or binoculars,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.56,0:14:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we might have something to work with.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that would be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't change into any\Nobject stronger than myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so explosives and large\Nmechanisms are off limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps there's another\Nway I can be of use.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.54,0:14:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already told you there's\Nnot a damn thing you can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.52,0:14:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here and let\Nus do what we do best!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.56,0:14:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That asshole thinks I'm just gonna let\Nhim trap his prey and make some super
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.42,0:14:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cool escape But he's about to find out\Nhe messed with the wrong stand users.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.72,0:15:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you gotta go for it Okuyasu\NI'm ready to go when you are buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.68,0:15:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This rusty tower has got nothing on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.46,0:15:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's bring it down Josuke
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.48,0:15:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right busting out of here is\Ngonna be a snap and a half
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.94,0:15:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.22,0:15:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn these dicks, how the\Nhell did they get so strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing's pretty freaking solid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.66,0:15:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we keep pounding\Nit like we have been,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll snap in two and\Nfall over in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.42,0:15:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See for yourself, you're about to come\Ncrashing down to good old terra firma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dumbass, do you think\Nyou two can scare me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.36,0:15:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling you'd go\Nstraight to using your fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.26,0:15:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you haven't noticed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.90,0:15:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This tower has absorbed the\Npower of your attacks and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.68,0:15:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has redistributed the force\Nover its entire structure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.14,0:15:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.05,0:15:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this jackass babbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.06,0:15:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.97,0:15:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be out of this metal\Ndeath trap before you know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.56,0:15:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.80,0:15:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.46,0:16:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.64,0:16:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting a real bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.12,0:16:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sound...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.03,0:16:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.46,0:16:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you're hearing is the\Nsound of the energy left over
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.12,0:16:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from your punches is reverberating\Nthroughout the whole tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.48,0:16:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.39,0:16:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind if I ask you boys a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.54,0:16:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have either of you ever heard\Nof the law of conservation?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.52,0:16:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once energy has been collected,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.26,0:16:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll eventually be released\Nfor use in a different form?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.92,0:16:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I wonder where it's gonna go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.16,0:16:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu, get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.16,0:16:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.88,0:16:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Punch the tower as much as you'd like!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.06,0:16:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the energy you two idiots\Nare putting out is just going to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.72,0:16:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go around and around and come\Nright back to bite you in the ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.90,0:16:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.94,0:16:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're only hurting yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.84,0:16:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not save the money and hospital\Nbills and accept that you're outmatched?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.86,0:16:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how strong you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing you do will be\Nable to destroy this tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.28,0:17:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.30,0:17:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm kinda worried, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.52,0:17:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't quick enough to dodge it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.42,0:17:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of those attacks\Nleft a hole in my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I should have warned\Nyou about that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.12,0:17:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see your thoughts racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.04,0:17:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think if you can manage to defeat\Nme, the user, you'll have a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.38,0:17:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's merely a pipe dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.64,0:17:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, this stand\Nexists independently of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.70,0:17:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I were to just drop dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.64,0:17:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that would never stop this tower from\Nensnaring victims until the end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.80,0:17:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Superfly's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.70,0:17:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.88,0:17:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.64,0:17:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look so serious, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.94,0:17:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is find\Nsomeone else to take your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.84,0:17:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not rocket science!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.38,0:17:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One person goes in and one comes out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.76,0:17:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a simple exchange!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.34,0:17:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trap some poor fool and get yourself out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:17:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kinda like that card game Old Maid!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.60,0:18:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a lot like human society!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.92,0:18:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hand over the Old Maid to some\Nother fool and get the hell out of Dodge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.76,0:18:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.06,0:18:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do, wholeheartedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.84,0:18:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pulling someone else in\Nwill certainly help Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.16,0:18:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howdy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.56,0:18:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I think you're the perfect candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.32,0:18:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to go back to the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.00,0:18:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're grounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.42,0:18:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.50,0:18:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mikitaka, you sly dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.58,0:18:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.54,0:18:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you come from and\Nhow are you a power line?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What sort of power is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.90,0:18:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How very kind of you to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I possess these powers\Ndue to my being an alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.26,0:18:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you've got him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to be useful, alien dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.80,0:18:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move quickly now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.76,0:18:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please exit the confines of the tower, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke. Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.84,0:18:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, you frickin' rock, Mikitaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.14,0:18:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard him, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.34,0:18:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.25,0:18:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave the tower before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, on my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.90,0:19:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.81,0:19:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made it out you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.82,0:19:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What even are you the guy\Nin the photo told me about
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.44,0:19:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke's allies But he never\Nmentioned a freak show like you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.22,0:19:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being an alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no knowledge of this\Nso-called old maid game
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.10,0:19:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't like the way\Nyou tricked Josuke and tried
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.06,0:19:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to trap him here forever It's\Nan awful lot like an adult
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.18,0:19:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beating a child at a New\NYear's card game by cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is why I brought you back\NYou don't deserve to be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.16,0:19:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're never leaving this tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.96,0:19:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.10,0:19:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I developed these really thick calluses\Nfrom swinging around up here all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.48,0:19:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're so thick, I can\Nhide things in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.04,0:19:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now die. Think head!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.72,0:19:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to assume what's in\Nyour hand is a part of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.84,0:19:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I am afraid that is a misconception.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.64,0:19:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you're holding isn't me, but the\Npower line you were hanging on to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.66,0:19:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see, I am fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.90,0:20:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.26,0:20:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was totally epic Mikitaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get yourself to the top and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.04,0:20:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.95,0:20:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After years of waiting, you finally\Nstepped into my tower's realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I'd let you walk away?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.22,0:20:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're looking at a man who\Nspent every moment of every
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.66,0:20:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,day thinking about escaping\Nthis godforsaken tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.96,0:20:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you already forgotten my warning?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.16,0:20:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This tower will return any attack back to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.14,0:20:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wire is also a part of this tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.82,0:20:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I purposely severed the line so\Nthat the opening would face you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this really the place\Nwhere I meet my end?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.66,0:20:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Mikitaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.76,0:20:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your ass out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.12,0:20:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can heal the wound, but\Nyou have to leave the tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.48,0:20:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.39,0:20:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only one leaving here is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.42,0:20:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Direction and angle check.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.06,0:21:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you strike it, it strikes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mikitaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.85,0:21:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sick bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.38,0:21:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You definitely made escaping a\Nlittle bit tougher, I must admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but all of that ugliness is behind us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.20,0:21:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would wager prying those suckers\Nout will sting just a touch,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you'll have all the\Ntime in the world to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.78,0:21:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel free to use the\Nmedicinal herbs in the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.34,0:21:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.25,0:21:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you somehow manage\Nto make it out of that tower,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.50,0:21:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll chase your deceitful\Nass to the ends of the earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.76,0:21:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you can try, but you won't succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.34,0:21:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what that old man told me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.88,0:21:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you still haven't even uncovered\Nthe whereabouts of Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.26,0:21:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kira!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.36,0:21:44.69,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,555)\pos(960,780)}July 15th (Thursday) 10:42 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.24,0:21:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.62,0:21:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen him before.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.50,0:21:56.71,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,555)\pos(960,780)}July 15th (Thursday) 8:14 AM
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.29,0:21:59.63,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,679)\pos(960,780)}July 15th (Thursday) 8:14 AM
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.34,0:22:05.76,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,427)\pos(960,780)}July 15th (Thursday) 10:38 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.90,0:22:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have to figure out who that man is.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.76,0:22:53.14,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.14,0:22:55.39,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.39,0:22:58.18,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.18,0:22:59.85,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.76,0:23:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need to try to\Nexplain it as old. I'm tired.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.85,0:23:02.23,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.23,0:23:04.61,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.36,0:23:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it happens again,\NI'ma move so slightly.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.61,0:23:07.40,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.72,0:23:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the arms and the lips and the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.32,0:23:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the human can have all\Nthat I need to. I want to.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.40,0:23:09.11,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.94,0:23:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and stand a little bit closer.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.11,0:23:11.36,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.12,0:23:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe in and get a bit higher.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.36,0:23:13.70,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.42,0:23:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know what\Nhit you when I get to you?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.70,0:23:15.33,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.33,0:23:17.95,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.88,0:23:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't\Nknow if I need you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.95,0:23:22.46,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.46,0:23:26.00,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.90,0:23:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I gotta find help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.88,0:23:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you, I don't know?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.01,0:23:31.47,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.62,0:23:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I need you, but I do,\Nbut I'm trying to find you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.47,0:23:34.85,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I would die to find out
